{"name":"The Closer Bell","slug":"glyph-closer-bell","blurb":"On the veto street, Vale carries the bell toward the bracket lamp. The mark is Closer. Click the bell and it lights. A touch does not keep a step. A step away from the lamp is not kept. A step is kept only when the gap shrinks. The page proves its own street law on load. Glyph: The Closer Bell.","seal":"7a07c38962bf466d609cf9358d6525eb3b436084e251154365577c3ca4c22b14"}
